          "title": "You'll want to know: पोहे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पोहे — pohe — \"flattened rice\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पोहे (pohe) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from pṛthuka, \"flattened rice or grain\" (CDIAL 8359). It is built on pṛthu, \"broad, flat\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
